WEBVTT

00:03:59.496 --> 00:04:02.005
as women struggle to make ends meet.

00:04:02.029 --> 00:04:04.504
The list goes on and goes wide.

00:04:05.262 --> 00:04:08.697
These dynamics are most acute
under conditions of poverty,

00:04:08.721 --> 00:04:11.229
from New Orleans to Nairobi.

00:04:12.907 --> 00:04:15.169
Too often, the story ends here.

00:04:15.193 --> 00:04:16.382
But not today.

00:04:17.177 --> 00:04:20.204
Another empowering truth begs to be seen.

00:04:20.228 --> 00:04:23.500
If we gain ground on gender equity,

00:04:23.524 --> 00:04:27.210
we also gain ground
on addressing global warming.

00:04:28.268 --> 00:04:31.945
This connection comes to light
in three key areas,